<runspec version="MOVES5.0.1">
	<description><![CDATA[County-domain (SINGLE) inventory for Washtenaw with TIME AGGREGATION by year,
as scale-county-timeagg-year (<aggregateBy key="Year"/>, <outputtimestep
value="Year"/>; January, April, July and October 2020, both day types, all 24
hours; road types 1 and 4), for the gasoline passenger car (21) and the
diesel combination long-haul truck (62). It selects the PM species (PM10 and
PM2.5 totals, EC, OC, NonECPM, sulfate, nitrate, ammonium, aerosol water, the
PM2.5 elements 51-59, PMOTHR, NCOM, TOM and the residual 121-124) and the PAH
particles at running, start, extended idle, APU and crankcase running, start
and extended idle, and the metals and dioxins/furans at running exhaust.
Its non-aggregated twin is scale-county-minor-species. No gaseous species, no
evaporative or refueling process. County database
county-inputs/washtenaw-county-timeagg/setup-timeagg.sql. The VMT output is ON
(<outputvmtdata value="true"/>): AirToxicsDistanceCalculator multiplies the
metal and dioxin rates by SHO.distance, which TotalActivityGenerator's TAG-9
writes only when VMT output is requested; scale-county-metals-novmt measures
the run without it.]]></description>
